## Commands

### `drill word [word]`
Classify ? Template A/B/C. Log word in progress.md. Track any new verb/root in verb-root-tracker.md.

### `drill root [root]`
Sarf-focused root family. Log root + any new verbs shown. Update tracker.

### `drill verb [verb]`
Full conjugation + masdar + participles. Mark verb **Drilled = yes** in tracker.

### `passage` or `maqta`
English passage ? user translates ? feedback with Sarf/Nahw. Add all new verbs/roots from the passage to tracker.

### `coverage` or `stats`
Report roots covered, verbs encountered, verbs drilled from verb-root-tracker.md.

## Vocabulary policy

Meaning, daily Najdi usage, Najdi alternative if uncommon, etymology when known.
